WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.753
"Help!" Ribby cried.

2
00:00:03.754 --> 00:00:10.615
She bobbed up and down in the water.

3
00:00:10.616 --> 00:00:14.437
"I'm coming!" Jeremy cried.

4
00:00:14.438 --> 00:00:24.523
"Swim, Ribby!"

5
00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:30.615
He jumped into his boat.

6
00:00:30.616 --> 00:00:34.264
Ribby's dress tangled around her legs.

7
00:00:34.265 --> 00:00:37.897
"I'm trying to swim!" she cried.

8
00:00:37.898 --> 00:00:41.343
"But my dress is too long!"

9
00:00:41.344 --> 00:00:44.969
Ribby splashed.

10
00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:54.330
She gulped water.

11
00:00:54.331 --> 00:00:58.429
Jeremy paddled as fast as he could.

12
00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:01.171
At last he reached Ribby.

13
00:01:01.172 --> 00:01:03.890
"Here," Jeremy said.

14
00:01:03.891 --> 00:01:09.483
"Grab my hand!"

15
00:01:09.484 --> 00:01:14.836
Jeremy pulled Ribby into the boat.

16
00:01:14.852 --> 00:01:17.792
Ribby coughed.

17
00:01:17.793 --> 00:01:22.798
She spit out water.

18
00:01:22.799 --> 00:01:28.010
"Thank you!" she said. "You saved me!"

19
00:01:28.011 --> 00:01:31.019
Jeremy sighed.

20
00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.184
"I will never bring you flowers again."

21
00:01:34.185 --> 00:01:39.052
Ribby smiled. "Good idea!"

22
00:01:39.053 --> 00:01:42.475
Jeremy thought for a second.

23
00:01:42.476 --> 00:01:46.414
"Do you like green fly sandwiches?"

24
00:01:46.415 --> 00:01:48.972
"Yes," Ribby said.

25
00:01:48.973 --> 00:01:52.190
"I love green fly sandwiches!"

26
00:01:52.191 --> 00:01:54.275
Jeremy grinned.

27
00:01:54.276 --> 00:01:57.204
"I made lots of sandwiches this morning.

28
00:01:57.205 --> 00:02:01.438
We can have a picnic for two!"

29
00:02:01.439 --> 00:02:08.318
"Look!" Ribby said. "There's Mr. Dribber.

30
00:02:08.319 --> 00:02:11.041
Can he come to our picnic?"

31
00:02:11.042 --> 00:02:16.470
Jeremy sighed. "Okay," he said.

32
00:02:16.471 --> 00:02:29.014
"We will have a picnic for three!"

